    "lines": [
     509,
     513
    ],
    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "We must distinguish three cases: - Java has read the extended time field itself and agrees with us (Java9 or Java8 and years prior to 2038) - Java has read the extended time field but found a year >= 2038 (Java8) - Java hasn't read the extended time field at all (Java7- or early Java8)"
   },
